# Building any of this module's nine main packages drops its binary here, named
# after its directory. All nine are listed, not just the ones someone has been
# bitten by: an agent running `go build ./tools/...` to check something is how a
# 13.8MB blob reached a commit once already. [LAW:no-silent-failure] The list
# said "three" while eight existed, so five of them were one careless build away
# from the commit this rule exists to prevent; keep it complete when a main
# package is added.
/doccites
/docclaims-sync
/lawtokens-check
/lawtokens-sync
/licenses
/lit
/mkmanifest
/perfbench
/testbudget

# tools/licenses output — regenerated at release build time
# (links-supply-chain-w6m9.1, .2); never hand-edited or committed.
/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES
/LICENSE-REPORT.md
/SBOM.cdx.json
